; https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri/blob/tauri-cli-v1.6.3/tooling/bundler/src/bundle/windows/templates/installer.nsi
; Keep this template in sync when updating the locked Tauri CLI.
; The explicit community publisher changes manufacturer-based installer state.
; Retain resonite ONLY as a legacy migration identifier for existing NSIS/MSI
; releases. Read current state first, and keep the legacy location for rollback.
